  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Security Observatories: A commitment by the territories</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s main objective is to strengthen the capacities of communities heavily affected by war through the design, implementation and sustainability of Community Security Observatories that will be a space of convergence for territorial organizations in four conflict affected regions in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
